  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If and when: the rule of wenn",
     "texto": [
      "**Wenn** means \"if\" (condition) and \"when\" (present or future moment): **Wenn es regnet, bleibe ich zu Hause** (if it rains, I stay at home).",
      "The verb of the clause with «wenn» goes to the end (**regnet**) and the next clause starts straight with its verb: **bleibe ich...**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Although: obwohl",
     "texto": [
      "**Obwohl** introduces a difficulty or contrast: **Obwohl ich müde bin, gehe ich zur Arbeit** (although I'm tired, I go to work). The verb also goes to the end: **bin**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
